    "updated_at": "2016-11-08T09:01:48Z",
    "body": "Yeah, you're conflating the returnValue attribute value with the handling of the return value of the callback. The callback return value is handled in step 4 of https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-event-handler-processing-algorithm as far as I can tell and there null causes cancellation.\n",
